      "body": "**tangentSpaceIso (A.3.iii) is NOT directly provable \u2014 critical path runs through the relative Pic functor, and a naive FGA rewire is a FALSE-axiom trap.**\n\n- `Pic0.tangentSpaceIso` (`Pic0AbelianVariety.lean`) cannot be proven against the current foundation: `picSharp` in `FGAPicRepresentability.lean` is `Classical.choice` of a `\u27e8sorry\u27e9` `Nonempty` \u2014 a fully opaque functor. No H\u00b9 comparison can attach to it. Do not re-probe the sorry directly.\n- **Critical path** (in order): (1) ~~real relative Pic presheaf~~ DONE session 0015 (`PicSharp.relPresheaf` in `RelPicFunctor.lean`, `H_T`-coset carrier, axiom-clean); (2) \u00e9tale sheafification target \u2014 Mathlib v4.31 has NO \u00e9tale Grothendieck topology on schemes; either parametrize or use Kleiman \u00a72 Thm 2.5: for C/k with a **k-rational section**, `Pic^\u266f(T) \u2192 Pic^\u266f_\u00e9t(T)` is already bijective, so representability can be stated against `relPresheaf` directly under a section hypothesis; (3) rewire FGA `picSharp` := (sheafified) relative functor \u2014 universe bump `Type u \u2192 Type (u+1)` in `HasPicSharp`/`HasPicScheme` is viable (`Functor.RepresentableBy` is universe-polymorphic; `Equiv` is cross-universe); (4) `Pic(C_\u03b5) \u2245 H\u00b9(C_\u03b5, O^\u00d7)` cocycle classification + truncated exponential split sequence `0 \u2192 O_C \u2192 O^\u00d7_{C_\u03b5} \u2192 O^\u00d7_C \u2192 1` for the kernel = `H\u00b9(C,O_C)` computation (Kleiman Thm 5.11) \u2014 none of this exists yet, largest remaining block.\n- **TRAP**: wiring `picSharp := PicSharp.presheaf` (the absolute functor, iso-class carrier) would make `PicSharpRepresentable`'s sorry a mathematically FALSE statement (absolute `Pic(C\u00d7T)` is not representable \u2014 it differs from `Hom(T, Pic)` by `Pic(T)`). Any rewire must use the relative (and in general sheafified) functor.\n- Proof-pattern notes: the `Quotient.lift`/`Quotient.sound` + iso-chain style (pullbackCongr/pullbackId/pullbackComp `.app`, D4\u2032 `pullbackTensorIsoOfLocallyTrivial`, `pullback_pullback_eq`) compiled essentially first-try \u2014 no v4.31 transparency walls in this corner. `pullback.lift_fst/snd` are NOT simp (only `@[reassoc]`); pass them + their `_assoc` forms to `simp` explicitly after `pullback.hom_ext`.",
