          "body": "**Update (run 0008): critical-path steps (2) and (3) are DONE via route (b) \u2014 \u00e9tale topology never needed.**\n\n- Kleiman \u00a72 Thm 2.5 route adopted: new class `Scheme.HasRationalPoint` (a section of `C.hom`); under it the plain `relPresheaf` IS the \u00e9tale sheaf, so FGA `picSharp := PicSharp.relPresheaf \u22d9 forget` (universe bump to `Type (u+1)` worked exactly as predicted here \u2014 `RepresentableBy` is universe-polymorphic).\n- `representable C` now extracts a REAL natural bijection $(T \\to \\mathrm{Pic}_{C/k}) \\simeq \\mathrm{Pic}(C\\times_k T)/\\pi_T^*\\mathrm{Pic}(T)$ (modulo the typed-sorry `instHasPicScheme`, whose statement is now true); `GrpObj`/`IsCommMonObj` on `PicScheme` are PROVED by Yoneda transport.\n- Remaining for `tangentSpaceIso`: step (4) only \u2014 $\\mathrm{Pic}(C_\\epsilon)\\cong H^1(C_\\epsilon,\\mathcal O^\\times)$ cocycle classification + truncated-exponential split sequence (Kleiman Thm 5.11), attached through `(representable C).homEquiv` at $T=\\operatorname{Spec} k[\\epsilon]$."
